sagi, a Vtuber who usually focuses on delivering Harakami.\nThank you for your appeal.\n\nI would like to commission you because I have seen your illustrations in the media section of Twitter and past skebs, and I like the atmosphere (especially the way you draw the eyes).\n\nI would like to ask you to do an illustration of me, Rito Shirousagi.\nI don't have any particular request in terms of composition, etc., but I would like to request an illustration with a bright atmosphere.\n\nI would also like to use the illustration as a thumbnail for a video distribution, so I would appreciate it if you could provide me with a transparent PNG image without a background.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/usagino_ri10tan/status/1626899328538406914?s=46&t=1zVXfj0yUQUeV1iFmN0ywg", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@357777777m/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2497079, "client_id": 165318, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1a329c1d/uploads/origins/28604f54-4235-412c-888c-0c38db867947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=851e1438ba267cacd45c1cc56f6fde5b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1a329c1d/uploads/origins/28604f54-4235-412c-888c-0c38db867947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=851e1438ba267cacd45c1cc56f6fde5b, https://si.imgix.net/1a329c1d/uploads/origins/28604f54-4235-412c-888c-0c38db867947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=832599ca1388f76246b89d8d874ceb62 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1a329c1d/uploads/origins/28604f54-4235-412c-888c-0c38db867947?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02cfeb40d42f25cdace96f0c80ab4745 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgi